  _playSoundIndex: 340
  _senarioDescription: "You pretend that you couldn't find anything out of the ordinary
    while investigating your home. You lie down in bed, shut your eyes, and pretend
    to drift to sleep. As you are halfway out of consciousness, you feel something
    graze your leg\u2026 A hand, coming from under your bed, prepared for this moment,
    you grab ahold of the creature's hand and break one of  their fingers. Releasing
    a bellowing roar, followed by a thick black smoke spewing from its broken finger.
    The smoke burns your eyes and lungs as you breathe it in, slowly losing consciousness. 
    When you awake, the smoke has cleared, and the creature is nowhere to be seen.
    In your hand, grasped firmly, is a black twig. Leaving you wondering what the
    hell that thing was. \\nSnappy Tappy - Ending"
